  "description": "Domain primitives shared by every Auderz microservice: Result/Error, Entity and\n      AggregateRoot, domain events, the auditing and concurrency contracts, invariant guards,\n      value objects, and identifier generation. Money comes from asom.lib.core.util and paging\n      from asom.lib's PagedDataCriteria, so neither is duplicated here.",
